# the seventh kind: Rumble (the Sound page's KNOB 1, Kind), on track 4: a new sound of it with NEW SOUND,
# a new pattern between the kick's beats, and the kick ducking it
wait 200
tap OCT+
tap OCT+
tap OCT+
expect track 3
expect kind3 3
tap ENV
tap ENV
expect view 4
spin K1 9
expect tpar6 7
# the kind changes with the next new sound
expect kind3 3
tapkey b10
wait 50
expect kind3 7
tapkey b9
wait 50
shot rumble.png
wav rumble.wav
tap PLAY
wait 6000
tap PLAY
wavstop
